  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ERKKI PULLI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Erkki Pulli was a Finnish politician and military officer who held the rank of Rear-Admiral of the White in the Royal Navy, known for his exceptional leadership and strategic thinking."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HELSINKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Helsinki is the birthplace of Erkki Pulli, a city in Finland."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH NAVY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Finnish Navy is where Erkki Pulli began his military career, rising through the ranks to become an officer."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROYAL NAVY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Royal Navy is the organization to which Erkki Pulli was appointed as a liaison officer and later received the rank of Rear-Admiral of the White."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH AND BRITISH GOVERNMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Finnish and British governments agreed on the special appointment of Erkki Pulli as Rear-Admiral of the White."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF NAVAL HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Naval History published a study highlighting Erkki Pulli's contributions to Anglo-Finnish naval cooperation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA LAHTINEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Lahtinen is a naval historian who conducted a study on Erkki Pulli's contributions to Anglo-Finnish naval cooperation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE NAVAL REVIEW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Naval Review is a publication of the Royal Navy that featured an article praising Erkki Pulli's achievements and the significance of his rank."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAPTAIN JAMES R. WILSON, RN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Captain James R. Wilson, RN wrote an article in The Naval Review praising Erkki Pulli's achievements and emphasizing the significance of his rank."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. JUHANI KORHONEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Juhani Korhonen is a Finnish historian who wrote a biography on Erkki Pulli, providing a comprehensive account of his life and career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH DEFENCE FORCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Finnish Defence Forces include the Finnish Army and Navy, where Erkki Pulli served and later played a crucial role in international peacekeeping missions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED NATIONS INTERIM FORCE IN LEBANON (UNIFIL)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UNIFIL is one of the United Nations peacekeeping operations where Erkki Pulli led Finnish contingents as a major."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED NATIONS DISENGAGEMENT OBSERVER FORCE (UNDOF)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UNDOF is another United Nations peacekeeping operation where Erkki Pulli played a crucial role as a major."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH PARLIAMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Erkki Pulli was elected to the Finnish Parliament in the 1990s, serving on the Defence Committee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Finnish Parliament is the legislative body where the person served as a member, focusing on national security interests."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORLD WAR II&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"World War II is the historical context in which Erkki Pulli's formative years were shaped, particularly his witnessing of Finnish soldiers' bravery and sacrifice."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOVIET UNION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Soviet Union is mentioned as the adversary during World War II, which influenced Erkki Pulli's early experiences and patriotism."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH ARMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Finnish Army is part of the Finnish Defence Forces where Erkki Pulli began his military career in the 1950s."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED NATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United Nations is the organization that Erkki Pulli served in through various peacekeeping missions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Finland is the country where Erkki Pulli was born, served in the military, and later became involved in politics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUNDRAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The tundras are the geographical region where Erkki Pulli's formative years were spent, particularly during World War II."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEFENCE COMMITTEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Defence Committee is a subcommittee within the Finnish Parliament where the person worked to promote national security interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defence Committee is a committee in the Finnish Parliament where Erkki Pulli served, promoting Finland's national security interests."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE PERSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The person is an individual who had a military career and later entered politics, serving in the Finnish Parliament and Defence Committee."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MILITARY CAREER&quot;">
